Z||000000||Ken Wittlief||11-24-2001||12:13 AM||||For some reaons this year I remembered back about 30 years, when I was a teenager<P> my stepmother had spent all day cooking and we were all sitting down for dinner with extended family.<P> The turkey was already carved, and I noticed some of the meat looked, well, pink.<P> Without thinking I asked, "Is the turkey suppose to be pink?"<P> and I immediately wished I could reach out and grab those words back - but it was too late.<P> (actually - compaired to chicken, turkey meat does look pinkish)<p>[This message has been edited by Ken Wittlief (edited 11-24-2001).]||||reg||11
